Q4. Write a Postman test script for a 'POST /wishlist' request (like adding an item to a Myntra wishlist) that checks if the response status is 201 and if the response body contains the correct product name.

Postman Test Script:

pm.test("Status Code is 201", function () {
    pm.response.to.have.status(201);
});

var data = pm.response.json();

pm.test("Product Name Correct", function () {
    pm.expect(data.product_name).to.eql("T-Shirt");
});

Expected Result:

✓ Status Code is 201
✓ Product Name Correct